SUMMARY:ROY ROGERS & the Delta Rhythm Kings Acoustic Show
DESCRIPTION:Stripped Down & Turned On: A Sit Down Acoustic Evening w/ Roy Rogers & The Delta Rhythm Kings” ~  Outdoor Sunset Series Dinner Show\nRoy Rogers has been considered one of the world’s preeminent master Delta slide guitarists with many decades of touring the globe. Over 20 recordings to his credit\, Rogers has garnered 8 Grammy nominations for producing\, as a recording artist\, and as a songwriter.  His collaborations have garnered major media accolades worldwide for producing critically acclaimed Grammy nominated recordings for John Lee Hooker and Ramblin’ Jack Elliott\, as well as collaborations with Bonnie Raitt\, Carlos Santana\, Bela Fleck\, Allan Toussaint\, Sammy Hagar & Ray Manzarek among others. Known for his searing performances that have been named a festival favorites including New Orleans Jazz Fest\, North Sea Jazz Festival in Holland\, Montreux in Switzerland\, Pistoia in Italy\, + North American festivals in Canada & the United States\, with more than 4 decades of touring the world.  Rogers is planning a release of the new single videos from the new release  “The Sky’s The Limit” – his first recording in 10 years with product releases in January 2026.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/roy-rogers-the-delta-rhythm-kings-acoustic-show-2/
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio\, 1 Old Rancheria Rd\, Nicasio\, CA\, 94946\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ranchonicasio.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Roy-Rogers.jpg
END:VEVENT
